1
00:00:03,974 --> 00:00:07,978
<font color="white">我就知道是你，伊多先生</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:09,312 --> 00:00:14,735
<font color="white">我一直被科學特搜隊的成員</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">和身分不明的敵人追擊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:15,402 --> 00:00:17,070
<font color="white">雖然不知道原因</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:18,155 --> 00:00:22,075
<font color="white">不過我總是感到不可思議</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">似乎在被誰引導著</font></font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:22,159 --> 00:00:24,494
<font color="white">你的目的到底是什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:24,578 --> 00:00:27,581
<font color="white">你是為了什麼才在背後出計謀劃？</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:27,664 --> 00:00:29,458
<font color="white">看來你們</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:29,541 --> 00:00:33,378
<font color="white">似乎對我有很大的誤解</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:00:34,004 --> 00:00:37,758
<font color="white">我既沒有在暗中密謀</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:00:37,841 --> 00:00:40,886
<font color="white">也沒有欺騙你們</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:00:41,428 --> 00:00:45,682
<font color="white">只是順應我應盡的使命罷了</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:00:46,308 --> 00:00:48,226
<font color="white">應盡的使命？</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:51,354
<font color="white">對，我的使命就是</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:00:52,147 --> 00:00:55,525
<font color="white">促進全宇宙的和平</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:27,617 --> 00:02:30,036
<font color="white">為了維持宇宙和平</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:30,620 --> 00:02:34,875
<font color="white">我必須抹殺超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:34,958 --> 00:02:36,126
<font color="white">我不懂</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:38,879
<font color="white">但是在這科學特搜隊</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:02:39,546 --> 00:02:43,550
<font color="white">創造出新的超人力霸王的人是你</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:47,929
<font color="white">為了殺掉超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:51,516
<font color="white">所以讓新的超人力霸王誕生是嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:02:52,726 --> 00:02:55,145
<font color="white">為什麼做事要那麼拐彎抹角？</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:02:55,770 --> 00:02:58,857
<font color="white">我先問你們一個問題</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:02:59,357 --> 00:03:01,818
<font color="white">何謂“超人力霸王”？</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:02,777 --> 00:03:07,782
<font color="white">你們真的認為超人力霸王是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">保護這顆星球的英雄嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:08,825 --> 00:03:10,285
<font color="white">你想說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:11,745 --> 00:03:14,706
<font color="white">2分57秒</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:14,789 --> 00:03:16,124
<font color="white">你在說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:16,750 --> 00:03:21,171
<font color="white">假設超人力霸王各自前往主要國家</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:21,254 --> 00:03:26,009
<font color="white">並且發動攻擊，癱瘓各國機能</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:26,509 --> 00:03:28,637
<font color="white">那過程所需的時間正是</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:29,638 --> 00:03:32,599
<font color="white">2分57秒</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:33,642 --> 00:03:35,352
<font color="white">你的意思是超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:35,894 --> 00:03:38,939
<font color="white">只要3分鐘就能侵略這顆地球？</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:39,522 --> 00:03:44,819
<font color="white">我們原先打算讓這地球成為</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:44,903 --> 00:03:47,614
<font color="white">星團評議會的一員</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:03:49,699 --> 00:03:56,248
<font color="white">然而在地球人心裡</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">根深蒂固的某種概念</font></font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:03:56,331 --> 00:03:58,250
<font color="white">成為了阻礙</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:05,548 --> 00:04:07,175
<font color="white">上啊，超人力霸王！</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:07,259 --> 00:04:11,263
<font color="white">-那即是對超人力霸王的信仰</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:12,639 --> 00:04:15,392
<font color="white">星團評議會無法放任</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:15,475 --> 00:04:19,020
<font color="white">超人力霸王那龐大的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:04:20,438 --> 00:04:23,316
<font color="white">偏頗的正義相當危險</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:23,900 --> 00:04:30,323
<font color="white">事實上，在這個宇宙裡</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">就有許多星球及種族</font></font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:31,032 --> 00:04:34,995
<font color="white">毀於超人力霸王之手</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:35,745 --> 00:04:39,791
<font color="white">為了阻止那份過火的正義</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:40,458 --> 00:04:46,715
<font color="white">只能除去深植人們心中的概念</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:04:47,841 --> 00:04:50,385
<font color="white">抹滅超人力霸王信仰</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:51,636 --> 00:04:58,643
<font color="white">然後引導地球的人類</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">成為宇宙真正的一員</font></font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:04:59,436 --> 00:05:03,106
<font color="white">那就是我的職責</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:05:04,858 --> 00:05:08,445
<font color="white">-那是什麼？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好巨大啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:05:09,237 --> 00:05:12,032
<font color="white">那是不是積頓？</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:05:12,574 --> 00:05:15,118
<font color="white">據說打敗過以前的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">超人力霸王的積頓？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:05:15,660 --> 00:05:17,620
<font color="white">感覺不太妙吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:05:18,204 --> 00:05:20,290
<font color="white">召喚積頓前來</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:05:20,874 --> 00:05:24,669
<font color="white">那也只不過是一種手段罷了</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:05:25,378 --> 00:05:28,548
<font color="white">既然要抹滅超人力霸王信仰</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:05:29,090 --> 00:05:33,803
<font color="white">那就必須除掉成了災難的超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:35,013 --> 00:05:37,766
<font color="white">也就是進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:37,849 --> 00:05:40,852
<font color="white">我得抹殺你才行</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:43,813 --> 00:05:45,148
<font color="white">我？</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:45,231 --> 00:05:47,609
<font color="white">夠了，不用再說了</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:48,693 --> 00:05:50,820
<font color="white">打倒那傢伙就行了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:05:50,904 --> 00:05:53,948
<font color="white">要召喚積頓出現</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:05:54,032 --> 00:05:57,118
<font color="white">還要再花上約一天的時間</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:05:57,202 --> 00:06:01,873
<font color="white">我很期待看到你們戰鬥的模樣</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:06:01,956 --> 00:06:02,999
<font color="white">伊多！</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:06:04,918 --> 00:06:05,877
<font color="white">可惡！</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:06:24,104 --> 00:06:26,272
<font color="white">都是我的錯</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:06:27,524 --> 00:06:28,608
<font color="white">不</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:06:29,776 --> 00:06:32,654
<font color="white">這一切是因我而起的</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:06:33,988 --> 00:06:36,533
<font color="white">若非得有人受責罵</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:06:37,951 --> 00:06:39,244
<font color="white">絕不會是你</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:06:40,411 --> 00:06:42,455
<font color="white">憑著我們的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:06:42,539 --> 00:06:47,168
<font color="white">阻止不了伊多與星團評議會</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:49,003 --> 00:06:51,089
<font color="white">只能將一切</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:06:51,172 --> 00:06:53,633
<font color="white">託付給新世代</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:06:55,802 --> 00:06:57,178
<font color="white">我明白</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:07:02,892 --> 00:07:04,060
<font color="white">妳醒啦？</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:07:05,311 --> 00:07:06,521
<font color="white">我想妳應該餓了吧</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:07:06,604 --> 00:07:10,191
<font color="white">進次郎呢？他在哪裡？</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:07:10,775 --> 00:07:12,068
<font color="white">誰知道</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:07:12,152 --> 00:07:14,863
<font color="white">我又不是學長的保母</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:07:14,946 --> 00:07:16,239
<font color="white">真是的</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:07:16,322 --> 00:07:18,491
<font color="white">-等一下，玲奈小姐</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不要阻止我</font></font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:07:19,075 --> 00:07:22,078
<font color="white">-我不會阻止妳的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-那是怎樣？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:07:23,121 --> 00:07:26,291
<font color="white">雖然我不知道學長在哪</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:27,250 --> 00:07:31,254
<font color="white">不過他一定很需要妳的陪伴</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:07:33,131 --> 00:07:34,424
<font color="white">謝謝你</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:07:40,138 --> 00:07:43,224
<font color="white">要是事情又變得麻煩，我可不管喔</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:07:43,933 --> 00:07:48,062
<font color="white">麻煩老早以前就有了</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:07:51,316 --> 00:07:52,484
<font color="white">聽得到嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:07:53,193 --> 00:07:54,360
<font color="white">諸星先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:07:55,236 --> 00:07:57,572
<font color="white">你現在最好不要回來</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:57,655 --> 00:07:59,324
<font color="white">公安還駐守在這裡</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:08:00,658 --> 00:08:05,455
<font color="white">我想請妳避開他們的耳目</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">準備某些東西，辦得到嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:08:05,538 --> 00:08:06,956
<font color="white">我試試看</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:09,292
<font color="white">很好，我傳清單給妳</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:08:10,460 --> 00:08:13,004
<font color="white">請問進次郎怎麼樣了？</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:08:13,087 --> 00:08:15,215
<font color="white">我跟那小子分頭行動</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:08:16,966 --> 00:08:18,551
<font color="white">他沒問題吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:08:19,344 --> 00:08:20,595
<font color="white">很難說</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:08:38,488 --> 00:08:39,405
<font color="white">玲奈小姐？</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:08:41,699 --> 00:08:43,159
<font color="white">終於找到你了</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:08:46,579 --> 00:08:50,124
<font color="white">這種時候妳在這裡做什麼啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:08:50,208 --> 00:08:52,126
<font color="white">那是我要說的</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:08:52,210 --> 00:08:54,420
<font color="white">你怎麼會在這種地方啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:08:54,504 --> 00:08:56,172
<font color="white">我找你找了好久</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:08:57,674 --> 00:08:58,758
<font color="white">找我？</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:08:59,342 --> 00:09:00,677
<font color="white">我一直在找你</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:09:02,762 --> 00:09:03,763
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:09:05,223 --> 00:09:09,519
<font color="white">有話一定要告訴你</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:09:10,103 --> 00:09:13,147
<font color="white">玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:09:15,191 --> 00:09:16,359
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:09:23,992 --> 00:09:25,785
<font color="white">成為超人力霸王了！</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:09:31,499 --> 00:09:33,334
<font color="white">-我知道</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什麼？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:09:35,211 --> 00:09:36,212
<font color="white">其實啊</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:09:37,755 --> 00:09:39,882
<font color="white">我也是超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:09:39,966 --> 00:09:42,510
<font color="white">那件事我很早之前就知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:09:43,177 --> 00:09:44,095
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:09:44,178 --> 00:09:46,097
<font color="white">等等，那不是重點</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:09:46,180 --> 00:09:49,392
<font color="white">我其實不是地球人，而是外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:09:49,976 --> 00:09:51,185
<font color="white">妳說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:09:51,269 --> 00:09:55,940
<font color="white">正確來說，我算是外星人的混血吧</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:09:59,485 --> 00:10:01,404
<font color="white">你不驚訝嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:10:01,487 --> 00:10:02,989
<font color="white">啊，沒有啦</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:10:04,532 --> 00:10:08,202
<font color="white">原來我跟玲奈小姐很像啊</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:10:08,828 --> 00:10:10,163
<font color="white">什麼意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:10:13,625 --> 00:10:14,792
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:10:16,044 --> 00:10:19,464
<font color="white">也許無法再當人類了</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:10:23,843 --> 00:10:25,053
<font color="white">難怪啊</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:10:26,220 --> 00:10:28,640
<font color="white">你聽到我是外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:10:28,723 --> 00:10:30,433
<font color="white">反應還這麼平淡</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:10:31,476 --> 00:10:33,853
<font color="white">我還以為你會更訝異呢</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:10:35,229 --> 00:10:37,231
<font color="white">不是因為那樣</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:10:37,315 --> 00:10:38,483
<font color="white">不然呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:10:41,319 --> 00:10:42,737
<font color="white">對我來說</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:10:42,820 --> 00:10:47,950
<font color="white">不管玲奈小姐是地球人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">或是外星人都無所謂</font></font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:10:49,035 --> 00:10:50,912
<font color="white">因為妳就是妳啊</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:10:53,790 --> 00:10:54,957
<font color="white">謝謝你</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:10:56,459 --> 00:10:57,502
<font color="white">不會</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:10:58,711 --> 00:11:01,464
<font color="white">說實話我本來很擔心</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:11:02,340 --> 00:11:04,967
<font color="white">你從梅菲斯特手中救了我吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:11:05,718 --> 00:11:10,890
<font color="white">那時候我總覺得</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">超人力霸王好像會到別處</font></font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:11:11,557 --> 00:11:14,394
<font color="white">所以我當時才那麼拼命</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:11:17,772 --> 00:11:18,856
<font color="white">謝謝</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:11:22,235 --> 00:11:25,905
<font color="white">但是現在已經不會再那樣憂慮了</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:11:27,198 --> 00:11:28,658
<font color="white">不管發生什麼事</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:11:29,534 --> 00:11:33,204
<font color="white">進次郎，你還會是你</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:11:35,873 --> 00:11:37,500
<font color="white">就是說啊</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:11:39,836 --> 00:11:44,132
<font color="white">我曾經害怕戰鬥時會傷害到某人</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:11:44,632 --> 00:11:48,010
<font color="white">或是給大家帶來困擾</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:11:48,761 --> 00:11:52,932
<font color="white">可是比起那些，我最畏懼的是</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:11:53,933 --> 00:11:55,685
<font color="white">我會失去自我</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:11:59,063 --> 00:12:00,273
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:12:04,402 --> 00:12:05,403
<font color="white">要出動了</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:12:55,244 --> 00:12:56,329
<font color="white">進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:13:00,666 --> 00:13:01,918
<font color="white">我也要跟你去</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:13:48,089 --> 00:13:50,091
<font color="white">（緊急事態</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">積頓再次逼近科學特搜隊）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:13:50,174 --> 00:13:54,011
<font color="white">外星人的宇宙飛船</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">有一隻怪獸正要出現</font></font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:13:54,095 --> 00:13:56,806
<font color="white">疑似為曾經打敗過超人力霸王的積頓</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:13:58,015 --> 00:14:01,686
<font color="white">宇宙飛船眼看已經逼近科學特搜隊</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:14:01,769 --> 00:14:04,313
<font color="white">積頓幾乎已經顯現全貌</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:14:04,939 --> 00:14:09,193
<font color="white">但科學特搜隊卻依然沒有任何動靜</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:14:16,868 --> 00:14:18,536
<font color="white">積頓要來了！</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:14:32,008 --> 00:14:33,676
<font color="white">積頓</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:14:43,686 --> 00:14:45,646
<font color="white">-超人力霸王！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-你太晚來了！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:14:45,730 --> 00:14:47,273
<font color="white">你在搞什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:14:47,356 --> 00:14:49,609
<font color="white">都是因為你們在，怪獸才會來大鬧！</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:14:49,692 --> 00:14:51,986
<font color="white">你就快點被幹掉吧！</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:14:53,070 --> 00:14:57,033
<font color="white">積頓的夢並不是爸的記憶</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:14:57,116 --> 00:14:59,744
<font color="white">而是我的命運</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:15:05,041 --> 00:15:06,792
<font color="white">幹得好，積頓！</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:15:06,876 --> 00:15:08,628
<font color="white">快點把帶來災難的人打倒！</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:15:10,713 --> 00:15:14,383
<font color="white">我已經不會再逃避了！</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:15:31,442 --> 00:15:33,361
<font color="white">我也能幫上忙</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:15:33,945 --> 00:15:36,989
<font color="white">-是新的超人力霸王？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-他還有同伴嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:15:37,073 --> 00:15:39,450
<font color="white">一起被積頓擊敗吧！</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:15:44,622 --> 00:15:45,623
<font color="white">糟了！</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:16:00,846 --> 00:16:02,431
<font color="white">積頓</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:16:03,474 --> 00:16:05,101
<font color="white">是他保護了我們嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:16:05,184 --> 00:16:06,268
<font color="white">怎麼可能！</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:16:06,352 --> 00:16:09,605
<font color="white">說到底那傢伙才是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">所有事情的罪魁禍首啊！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:16:09,689 --> 00:16:14,068
<font color="white">-破壞一點瓦礫就想贖罪？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-他是危險分子！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:16:20,574 --> 00:16:22,535
<font color="white">進次郎，你還好嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:16:25,663 --> 00:16:28,499
<font color="white">你們不見才是為地球好啦！</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:16:28,582 --> 00:16:30,376
<font color="white">-沒錯！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-就是說啊！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:16:30,459 --> 00:16:32,128
<font color="white">積頓</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:16:48,728 --> 00:16:50,229
<font color="white">他為什麼要站起來？</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:17:22,762 --> 00:17:25,139
<font color="white">-積頓，加油！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-被幹掉吧！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:17:36,567 --> 00:17:37,485
<font color="white">進次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:17:58,672 --> 00:18:00,841
<font color="white">究竟發生什麼事了？</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:18:00,925 --> 00:18:03,469
<font color="white">趁這場混亂逃跑吧</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:18:05,137 --> 00:18:06,430
<font color="white">好</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:18:08,557 --> 00:18:10,518
<font color="white">你們在這裡搞什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:18:11,143 --> 00:18:13,604
<font color="white">北斗？到底出什麼事了？</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:18:13,687 --> 00:18:15,856
<font color="white">動作快，總之趁現在快走</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:18:20,236 --> 00:18:23,322
<font color="white">他一個人迎擊那個大怪獸？</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:18:23,405 --> 00:18:25,157
<font color="white">你幹嘛佩服啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:18:25,241 --> 00:18:28,911
<font color="white">因為超人力霸王太過危險</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">那個大怪獸才來打倒他吧</font></font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:18:28,994 --> 00:18:30,246
<font color="white">根本是自作自受</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:18:30,329 --> 00:18:32,915
<font color="white">還打沒勝算的仗，簡直是笨蛋</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:18:32,998 --> 00:18:37,253
<font color="white">但也許那樣才算是真正的英雄啊</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:18:58,524 --> 00:18:59,817
<font color="white">加油！</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:19:04,613 --> 00:19:05,656
<font color="white">還沒完</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:19:09,577 --> 00:19:10,995
<font color="white">我的防護罩！</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:19:17,835 --> 00:19:19,879
<font color="white">你在拖拖拉拉什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:19:19,962 --> 00:19:21,589
<font color="white">諸星先生！</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:19:21,672 --> 00:19:23,215
<font color="white">真虧你撐過來了</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:19:24,425 --> 00:19:26,468
<font color="white">我們上吧，進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:19:26,552 --> 00:19:27,678
<font color="white">是！</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:19:47,448 --> 00:19:48,824
<font color="white">各位！</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:19:48,908 --> 00:19:51,035
<font color="white">進次郎、諸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:19:51,118 --> 00:19:52,578
<font color="white">抱歉我們來晚了</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:19:52,661 --> 00:19:56,498
<font color="white">我可不樂見只有學長你們備受矚目啊</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:19:57,124 --> 00:19:58,959
<font color="white">就陪陪你們吧</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:19:59,043 --> 00:20:00,252
<font color="white">我是井手</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:20:01,378 --> 00:20:03,047
<font color="white">我們奪回科學特搜隊了</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:20:04,215 --> 00:20:06,467
<font color="white">我們也會負責後援</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:20:06,550 --> 00:20:07,718
<font color="white">-了解</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-是！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:20:07,801 --> 00:20:09,094
<font color="white">積頓又來了</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:20:11,430 --> 00:20:13,807
<font color="white">-準備上吧！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-是！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:20:18,062 --> 00:20:19,480
<font color="white">我也能夠出一份力！</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:20:52,012 --> 00:20:53,889
<font color="white">這招如何？</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:21:45,816 --> 00:21:47,109
<font color="white">好耶！</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:50,362
<font color="white">真是優秀的助攻啊，小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:21:54,992 --> 00:21:56,910
<font color="white">我等很久了</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:21:56,994 --> 00:21:58,120
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:21:59,163 --> 00:22:01,665
<font color="white">我深感榮幸</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:22:02,583 --> 00:22:07,004
<font color="white">能夠見證你們這些</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">新世代的超人力霸王</font></font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:22:07,087 --> 00:22:10,049
<font color="white">被擊潰的瞬間</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:22:26,565 --> 00:22:31,028
<font color="white">超人力霸王信仰將邁向終結</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:24:05,038 --> 00:24:08,125
<font color="white">字幕翻譯：陳盈華</font><font color="white"></font>

